Object-temperature calculation adapted from Nathan Seidle / SparkFun Electronics and the EmotiBit fork, commit 388e79f4621c6127c3e9621f01e30783e16e2a9c. Zephtastic supplies its own Zephyr register transport and nonblocking scheduler.

